+### Compound Durations
+
+Use `parseCompound` to sum several `<number><unit>` pieces. Pieces can be separated by whitespace, commas, or nothing at all.
+
+```ts
+import { parseCompound } from 'ms';
+
+parseCompound('1h 30m'); // 5400000
+parseCompound('1h, 30m'); // 5400000
+parseCompound('2 days 4 hours'); // 187200000
+```
+
+Every piece needs a unit. Invalid input (e.g. `"1h 30"` or `"1h 30x"`) throws a `TypeError`.
+
 ## Edge Runtime Support
 
 `ms` is compatible with the [Edge Runtime](https://edge-runtime.vercel.app/). It can be used inside environments like [Vercel Edge Functions](https://vercel.com/edge) as follows:
